## No firmware assets

This repository contains **no NVIDIA firmware blobs**. Every `.bin` the loader
needs (`fwimage_*`, `gsp_boot_*`, `booter_load_*`, `v67-*`) is generated locally
by upstream's `make-usbroot.ps1` from publicly pinned NVIDIA packages.
